From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chelovechishee <261262090+chelovechishee@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 51/52] media: samsung: add the Exynos 7885 CSIS receiver with
 DMA

The CSIS v5.1 MIPI CSI-2 receivers write what they receive straight to
memory, without the camera ISP and its closed library: raw Bayer frames
(RAW10 in 16 bit words) for a software ISP such as libcamera's. One video
node per receiver, linked from the sensor; the D-PHY is switched with its
PMU isolation and SYSREG_CAM reset bits.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
