+	  The MIPI CSI-2 receivers (CSIS v5.1) of the Exynos 7885 with their
+	  own write DMA: raw Bayer frames from a camera sensor to memory,
+	  without the camera ISP.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
+	  will be called exynos7885-csis.
